{
  "glassbox": 2,
  "id": "twister-surface",
  "title": "Who the Twister is for",
  "notes": [
    "PWYF's Midi Fighter Twister serves the pedals and the looper. This says which of them has it now, and so which process may paint its rings: the state IS the owner (plan docs/kb/plans/quadrat-the-sampler.md, phase 3, step 1).",
    "Transcribed from Component.App (syncSceneToBank, handleEncoderTurn, SetView), 2026-11-04, not designed: a scene wins over everything; otherwise focus decides.",
    "The host keeps what is data, not mode: WHICH pedal is focused, WHICH scene, and the looper's page (0-3), which the pager knob's position chooses. Each repaint is an entry command, so arriving by any road paints the same way.",
    "Re-entry is deliberate in three places: focus moving from one pedal to another, the pager turning, and one scene giving way to another. Each is a 'to' the same state, which re-runs the entry and repaints.",
    "Focus changes during a scene are remembered by the host and change nothing on the device; leaving the scene hands the Twister to what focus says then (the looper-focused fact)."
  ],
  "initial": "pedal",
  "clock": "milliseconds",
  "states": [
    {
      "id": "pedal",
      "label": "A pedal's page",
      "entry": [
        "paint-pedal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "looper",
      "label": "The looper's page",
      "entry": [
        "paint-looper"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scene",
      "label": "A scene",
      "entry": [
        "paint-scene"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "focus-pedal",
      "label": "a pedal is focused",
      "source": "user"
    },
    {
      "id": "focus-looper",
      "label": "the looper is focused",
      "source": "user"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-on",
      "label": "the MC6 stands on a bank with a scene",
      "source": "runtime"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-off",
      "label": "the MC6 leaves that bank",
      "source": "runtime"
    },
    {
      "id": "pager",
      "label": "the pager knob turns",
      "source": "user"
    }
  ],
  "config": [],
  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "looper-focused",
      "label": "The looper is the focused pedal"
    }
  ],
  "refusals": [
    {
      "id": "no-pager",
      "text": "a pedal's page has no pager; the looper is not focused"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-holds",
      "text": "a scene holds the Twister; leave its MC6 bank first"
    }
  ],
  "commands": [
    {
      "id": "paint-pedal",
      "label": "Dim every ring, then paint the focused pedal's controls"
    },
    {
      "id": "paint-looper",
      "label": "Paint the looper's current page from the daemon's snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "paint-scene",
      "label": "Dim every ring, then paint the scene's controls"
    }
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "from": "pedal",
      "on": "focus-pedal",
      "cases": [
        {
          "to": "pedal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "pedal",
      "on": "focus-looper",
      "cases": [
        {
          "to": "looper"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "pedal",
      "on": "scene-on",
      "cases": [
        {
          "to": "scene"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "pedal",
      "on": "scene-off",
      "cases": [
        {
          "stay": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "pedal",
      "on": "pager",
      "cases": [
        {
          "refuse": "no-pager"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "looper",
      "on": "focus-pedal",
      "cases": [
        {
          "to": "pedal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "looper",
      "on": "focus-looper",
      "cases": [
        {
          "stay": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "looper",
      "on": "scene-on",
      "cases": [
        {
          "to": "scene"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "looper",
      "on": "scene-off",
      "cases": [
        {
          "stay": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "looper",
      "on": "pager",
      "cases": [
        {
          "to": "looper"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "scene",
      "on": "focus-pedal",
      "cases": [
        {
          "stay": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "scene",
      "on": "focus-looper",
      "cases": [
        {
          "stay": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "scene",
      "on": "scene-on",
      "cases": [
        {
          "to": "scene"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "scene",
      "on": "scene-off",
      "cases": [
        {
          "when": {
            "fact": "looper-focused"
          },
          "to": "looper"
        },
        {
          "to": "pedal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "scene",
      "on": "pager",
      "cases": [
        {
          "refuse": "scene-holds"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}